{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Sound Baths & Resonant Events</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{BUSINESS_NAME}} offers curated sound baths blending crystal bowls, gong, tuning forks and monochord for restorative group experiences.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
<script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="earthy">
<header class="site-header">
<div class="wrap">
<a class="logo" href="index.html">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
<nav class="nav">
<a href="index.html">Home</a>
<a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
<a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
<a href="about.html">About</a>
<a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div class="hero-text">
<h1>Slow down into sound — a warm, curated immersion</h1>
<p class="tagline">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
<p class="lead">Join {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} at {{VENUE_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} for a sensory ceremony of bowls, gong and subtle tuning forks. Next circle: <strong>{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</strong>.</p>
<p class="meta">Intimate groups • 75–90 minutes • Limited spots</p>
<div class="actions">
<a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
<a class="btn ghost" href="events.html">View schedule</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
<svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="none">
<defs>
<linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="#f7efe6"/>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="#efe3d8"/>
</linearGradient>
</defs>
<rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g)"/>
<image href="assets/img/pattern.svg" x="0" y="0" width="600" height="400"/>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="diagnostic">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Before you arrive — a quick guide</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div>
<h3>What to bring</h3>
<ul>
<li>Yoga mat or cushion, blanket, eye pillow</li>
<li>Water bottle, light layer for warmth</li>
<li>Open curiosity — phones off</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Contraindications</h3>
<p>Sound baths are gentle but powerful. Please consult us before booking if you have: pregnancy, active epilepsy, pacemaker/metal implants, recent surgery, severe psychiatric conditions. This session is not a substitute for medical care.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Flow of the evening</h3>
<ol>
<li>Arrival & grounding — intention setting</li>
<li>Guided breath & gentle tuning</li>
<li>Deep sound journey — bowls, gong, chimes</li>
<li>Soft reintegration — silence and tea</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="plan">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>How a sound experience is designed</h2>
<p>A careful architecture of frequency and silence: we layer crystal bowls, a warm gong swell, metallic chimes and light monophonic drones to open the nervous system, then steady the descent with tuning forks and voice.</p>
<div class="features">
<article>
<h4>Intention-driven set</h4>
<p>Each circle begins with a brief intention and breath work to invite presence.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h4>Instrumental palette</h4>
<p>We mix instruments for texture — e.g. crystal bowls, chimes, monochord and subtle tuning forks — chosen to hold space for deep listening.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h4>Facilitation</h4>
<p>{{FACILITATOR_NAME}} curates tone, volume and transitions to ensure a premium, safe journey.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="micro_habits">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Micro-habits to carry the session home</h2>
<ul class="habits">
<li><strong>Three mindful breaths</strong> before sleep after a session</li>
<li><strong>Silence window:</strong> 10 minutes of quiet each evening</li>
<li><strong>Resonant hum:</strong> a 30-second chest hum to reset the nervous system</li>
</ul>
<p class="poem">Small sonic rituals. Daily return.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="pricing">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Offerings & investment</h2>
<div class="grid prices">
<div>
<h3>Community Circle</h3>
<p>Group sound bath — 75–90 min</p>
<p class="price">$35</p>
<a class="btn" href="events.html">Reserve</a>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Drop-in Meditation</h3>
<p>Light sound & guided rest — 45 min</p>
<p class="price">$20</p>
<a class="btn" href="book.html">Book</a>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Private Session</h3>
<p>1:1 deep work — 60 min</p>
<p class="price">$140</p>
<a class="btn" href="private-sessions.html">Inquire</a>
</div>
</div>
<p class="fine">Sliding scale & packages available. See full pricing page for details.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
<div class="wrap cta-card">
<h2>Reserve your place</h2>
<p>Spaces are small. Come early to settle.</p>
<form id="bookForm" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="get">
<input type="hidden" name="source" value="index">
<input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
<input name="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>
<button type="submit" class="btn primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
</form>
</div>
</section>

<footer class="site-footer">
<div class="wrap footer-grid">
<div>
<p class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</p>
<p>{{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
</div>
<div>
<p>Contact</p>
<p>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
<p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
</div>
<nav>
<a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
<a href="pricing.html">Pricing</a>
<a href="about.html">The facilitator</a>
</nav>
</div>
</footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>"} 
